1
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:17,360
Don't let

2
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,080
her get away!

3
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:18,680
After her!

4
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,760
Come back here!

5
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,800
I see you.

6
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:29,800
Stop!

7
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:31,160
Don't run!

8
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:31,880
Stop!

9
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:32,520
Help me,

10
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,040
miss!

11
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:33,880
Don't be afraid.

12
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,600
We'll protect you and get you home.

13
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:35,120
Police!

14
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,360
Freeze!

15
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:37,220
That's my wife.

16
00:00:37,680 --> 00:00:38,800
What's with

17
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,920
the attitude?

18
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:33,560
Wei,

19
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,140
you're up so early.

20
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:36,960
What are you doing sitting here?

21
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:38,960
Nothing.

22
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,240
You're drinking something cold
right after waking up?

23
00:01:44,240 --> 00:01:44,840
I'm young.

24
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:46,560
My stomach likes it cold.

25
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,120
How have you been sleeping

26
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,180
since you moved in?

27
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:54,890
Pretty well.

28
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:11,780
By the way, Wei,

29
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:12,680
did you

30
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:14,600
have a nightmare last night?

31
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,890
How did you know?

32
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:17,900
I stayed up late

33
00:02:20,160 --> 00:02:22,160
making notes yesterday.

34
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,280
Then I suddenly heard you yelling,

35
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,320
"Help! Help!" from your room.

36
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:26,760
I thought something happened.

37
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,120
I went over and saw you were dead asleep.

38
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,380
So I didn't wake you up.

39
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:31,060
Really?

40
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,340
What else did I say?

41
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,320
You said,

42
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,920
"Chang Kaixin did a great job
on the last case,

43
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:42,520
and she deserves special praise."

44
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,320
You also said,

45
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,640
"We should listen to
Chang Kaixin's opinions more,

46
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:47,680
and we shouldn't criticize her."

47
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:49,880
Are you talking in your sleep or am I?

48
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:52,480
Wei,

49
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,280
I can also interpret dreams.

50
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,120
Wanna hear it?

51
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,120
Stop joking around.

52
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:55,800
Go clean up.

53
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:16,120
Shan,

54
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,000
why so early?

55
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:20,079
Take a look at the file first.

56
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,240
This case

57
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,170
is a bit unusual.

58
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:25,060
Both the suspect and the victim
are seniors over 60.

59
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,780
And they are husband and wife.

60
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,210
That afternoon,

61
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:35,079
I was cleaning.

62
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:39,440
He came over to ask for the demolition
compensation for the homestead.

63
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,079
I refused,

64
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,600
so he hit me.

65
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:42,810
Mom, Dad,

66
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,020
we're leaving.

67
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:46,240
Goodbye, Grandpa and Grandma.

68
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,520
Be good out there.

69
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:48,640
Don't run around.

70
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,860
Mom, don't worry about us.

71
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,530
Say goodbye to Grandma.

72
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,840
Bye-bye.

73
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:58,960
I told you ages ago

74
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,820
to transfer that money to my card.

75
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,450
Why haven't you done it yet?

76
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,240
I'm talking to you.

77
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,100
Did you hear me?

78
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,960
I can't transfer that money.

79
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,600
It's saved for our grandson.

80
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,570
Isn't your pension enough for you?

81
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,320
What do you need that money for?

82
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,000
Do I have to report

83
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,260
everything I do to you?

84
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:18,320
Who's the boss in this house anyway?

85
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,380
That money is mine.

86
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,100
Why should I give it to you?

87
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,250
What are you talking about?

88
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,040
Stop pretending.

89
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,760
You think I don't know what you're up to?

90
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:32,240
You're destined to be poor.

91
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:34,370
You wouldn't even know how to spend it.

92
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,800
Transfer it to me right now.

93
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,280
No.

94
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,520
Are you going to give it to me or not?

95
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:38,960
No.

96
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,400
How dare you!

97
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,840
I'll kill you!

98
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,760
You're hitting me again.

99
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,570
I've been with you for decades,

100
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,460
and all you do is beat and scold me.

101
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,240
I've had enough.

102
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,760
You...

103
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,700
I'm taking you down with me today!

104
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,200
I'm taking you down!

105
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,240
Come on!

106
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,320
Fine!

107
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:04,560
You've got some nerve,

108
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,080
threatening me with a knife.

109
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:08,740
I'll show you what happens
when you threaten me!

110
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,640
I'll choke you to death,

111
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,080
you old hag!

112
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,730
That's what you get for disobeying me!

113
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,720
Li Hongkang was already stabbed
and on the ground.

114
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:49,180
Why did you stab him again?

115
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,880
I was worried

116
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,820
he wasn't dead yet,

117
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,300
so I stabbed him again.

118
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:56,450
Who else was at home at the time?

119
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,960
Just me and Li Hongkang.

120
00:05:58,560 --> 00:06:00,320
When did you start arguing?

121
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,760
In the afternoon,

122
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:05,840
after my daughter-in-law
left with my grandson.

123
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:06,840
Around what time?

124
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,840
I can't remember.

125
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,400
I killed him.

126
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,460
I plead guilty.

127
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:15,240
Please sentence me as soon as possible.

128
00:06:15,440 --> 00:06:16,120
I beg

129
00:06:17,040 --> 00:06:18,200
you.

130
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,880
According to the autopsy report,

131
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,600
the first stab was the fatal wound.

132
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,480
It was caused by
an underhand straight thrust

133
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,810
to the left of the navel.

134
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,480
The blade penetrated the abdominal wall,

135
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:57,880
damaging the small intestine
and mesenteric vessels,

136
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,010
causing massive abdominal bleeding.

137
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,280
The second stab was overhand,

138
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:19,400
with the arm raised high

139
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,480
and the blade pointing down.

140
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,440
This matches Zhou Yumei's confession.

141
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:25,000
This stab didn't directly damage
any major organs,

142
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,930
but it accelerated the blood loss.

143
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:31,860
Li Hongkang bled heavily,

144
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:33,600
but it was all concentrated
in the abdominal cavity.

145
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:34,760
Normally,

146
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:37,780
a stab to the abdomen
wouldn't cause blood spatter.

147
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:39,720
So why is the knife handle covered

148
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,380
in such a large patch of blood?

149
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,600
I have nothing more to confess.

150
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,560
You said killing Li Hongkang
was a spur-of-the-moment decision.

151
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,120
But the traces at the crime scene

152
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,960
contradict your statement.

153
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,800
I suspect you are lying.

154
00:08:00,280 --> 00:08:01,140
Why did you lie?

155
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,480
What are you hiding?

156
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,010
I didn't.

157
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,480
I didn't lie.

158
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,240
Li Hongkang deserved to die.

159
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,240
I should have killed him a long time ago.

160
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:10,300
You confessed that

161
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:12,640
Li Hongkang asked you for a sum of money.

162
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,540
No one is touching this money.

163
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:18,840
Wei,

164
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:21,520
Beitan People's Procuratorate

165
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,850
What are your thoughts?

166
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,560
Zhou Yumei once confessed that

167
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,040
she was cut by Li Hongkang,

168
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:30,200
but her blood wasn't detected
on the knife.

169
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:34,679
And the amount of Li Hongkang's blood
on the knife handle was unusually large.

170
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,919
None of this makes sense.

171
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,799
The key is that

172
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:38,039
Zhou Yumei is very resistant

173
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:40,120
to communicating with
the legal aid lawyer.

174
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,580
She keeps pleading guilty

175
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,240
and urging us to convict her quickly.

176
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:45,680
Zhou Yumei's behavior
is indeed a bit unusual.

177
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:48,040
Normally, she should actively
cooperate with the lawyer

178
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,280
to get a reduced sentence.

179
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,160
Beitan Municipal People's Procuratorate

180
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,880
Zhou Yumei was born in the countryside.

181
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:54,240
Her son died in a car accident
three years ago.

182
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,920
Now her husband is gone too.

183
00:08:56,080 --> 00:08:59,040
Could it be that she couldn't take it

184
00:08:59,040 --> 00:09:00,040
and just gave up?

185
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,440
But she still has a grandson.

186
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,920
Logically, as a grandmother,

187
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:06,080
she should still have
something to live for.

188
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,480
But according to Zhou Yumei's confession,

189
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:09,800
their conflict

190
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:12,530
mainly centered on
the 300,000 demolition fund.

191
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,080
There's another detail.

192
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,240
When their only son, Li Shaofeng,

193
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,680
had the car accident three years ago,

194
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,480
they received an 800,000 compensation.

195
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:21,080
This matter was mostly
handled by Li Hongkang.

196
00:09:22,280 --> 00:09:22,960
At present,

197
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,640
there is indeed no problem
with the chain of evidence.

198
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,040
It seems to be fine.

199
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:27,800
But I think

200
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:30,320
the motive for murder is insufficient.

201
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,200
We need to investigate further.

202
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,680
Our office also has a new technology.

203
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:37,080
Based on the suspect's confession
and the scene,

204
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,760
we use 3D modeling

205
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,800
to reconstruct the crime scene.

206
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,530
We can also start from here.

207
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:52,200
All these knives and blood this morning

208
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,240
ruined my appetite.

209
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,360
You have to get used to it.

210
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,520
How can you work without eating?

211
00:09:57,520 --> 00:09:58,850
Build up your appetite.

212
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,360
Weiwei,

213
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,220
I'm at the gate of your workplace.

214
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,720
I brought you something.

215
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,040
You guys go eat first.

216
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:09,840
Where are you going?

217
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,200
It's nothing.

218
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,260
I'll be right back.

219
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,160
Sir,

220
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:17,400
just open the gate

221
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,400
and let me in.

222
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:20,090
My daughter works here.

223
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:21,160
I brought her some food.

224
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,360
I'll be right out.

225
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,520
We have rules here.

226
00:10:23,520 --> 00:10:25,400
Not just anyone can enter.

227
00:10:25,880 --> 00:10:27,920
Why are you so stubborn?

228
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:30,500
Will you get fired just for letting me in?

229
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,480
We have strict rules.

230
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:32,760
What rules?

231
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,160
No entry means no entry.

232
00:10:33,160 --> 00:10:33,720
Mom, what are you doing?

233
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,080
No entry.

234
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:34,720
Rules are inflexible.

235
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,000
Sorry, I'm so sorry.

236
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:36,960
Look, see?

237
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:37,520
Enough.

238
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:38,840
I told you my daughter is a prosecutor.

239
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,280
And you didn't believe me.

240
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:40,120
Are you done?

241
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,840
Sorry.

242
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,800
Are you out of your mind?

243
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:42,280
Enough.

244
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:43,210
What do you want?

245
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,360
What kind of workplace is this?

246
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,280
Just go.

247
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,240
So much trouble.

248
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,360
Where are you living now?

249
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,560
Your uncle rented a place in Beitan.

250
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,920
I didn't want to bother you,

251
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,250
so I'm staying with him.

252
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:58,120
I haven't seen you in a long time.

253
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,450
I made two of your favorite dishes.

254
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,360
I'm busy with work.

255
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,820
I'll go back when I'm done.

256
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,600
Okay.

257
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,360
Your uncle

258
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,120
has been talking about you lately.

259
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,250
He wants to visit you

260
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:12,840
when you're free.

261
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:13,780
No need.

262
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,260
I don't want to see him.

263
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,600
Why are you being so petty?

264
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,610
It's been so many years.

265
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,690
You still haven't let it go?

266
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:25,580
Your uncle is different from before.

267
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:27,410
I don't care how he's doing,

268
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,540
as long as he stays out of my sight.

269
00:11:29,680 --> 00:11:30,800
Weiwei,

270
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:33,140
I brought you some of this.

271
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:33,720
American ginseng

272
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:34,440
and Ejiao.

273
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,200
Take it.

274
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,320
Weiwei,

275
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,160
stop being mad,

276
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:37,840
okay?

277
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,440
Don't be mad.

278
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,600
Weiwei,

279
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:42,280
Why are you so stubborn,

280
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:43,440
kid?

281
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,360
He's your own uncle.

282
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,760
What can't be talked out?

283
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:49,820
AROM, fine.

284
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,040
AROM, I'll say no more.

285
00:11:51,040 --> 00:11:52,700
Weiwei still has to go to work.

286
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,880
This kid is so stubborn.

287
00:11:58,080 --> 00:11:58,760
Alright,

288
00:11:58,760 --> 00:11:59,280
let's go.

289
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:00,210
Let's head back.

290
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:01,680
Let's go.

291
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:26,720
She's my wife.

292
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,120
I haven't even taken a good look at her,

293
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,080
and you're already staring.

294
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:30,520
Congratulations,

295
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,040
Dayou.

296
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,360
I saw the girl.

297
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,960
She's really pretty.

298
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,760
You need to starve her for a few days

299
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,690
so she won't have the energy to run.

300
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,600
Get out.

301
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,880
I don't need you to teach me.

302
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:42,410
Look how impatient you are.

303
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:53,360
Move again,

304
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,720
and I'll kill you.

305
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,360
You need to be starved for a few days.

306
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,010
I brought you lunch.

307
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:26,160
What's wrong?

308
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,900
Too much pressure lately?

309
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,160
I'm fine.

310
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:32,840
Tell me if something's up.

311
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,300
Don't keep it to yourself.

312
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,920
A colleague just saw

313
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:39,840
an older lady looking for you.

314
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:41,920
Was it your mom?

315
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,040
I know

316
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:50,480
you still can't get over
what happened back then.

317
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:52,940
I never cared about
what happened back then.

318
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,290
It's my mom's attitude.

319
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:57,690
Understood.

320
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,720
There's a new lead in Zhou Yumei's case.

321
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,160
What?

322
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,360
The police found

323
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,560
suspected infidelity on her phone.

324
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,880
The guy's name is Lu Minchuan.

325
00:14:08,880 --> 00:14:10,280
An extramarital affair?

326
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:13,320
Was this person mentioned
in Zhou Yumei's previous statement?

327
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,320
She never mentioned him
from start to finish.

328
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,960
And according to the chat history,

329
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,360
they've been talking
for at least a few months.

330
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,720
Zhou Yumei trusted him a lot,

331
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:22,560
even saying she'd transfer
the demolition compensation to him.

332
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:23,760
It's not that simple.

333
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:25,440
This Lu Minchuan

334
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:27,280
allegedly hinted that Zhou Yumei

335
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,520
should kill Li Hongkang

336
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:29,580
and elope with him.

337
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,620
If that's the case,

338
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:32,800
their conflict

339
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,400
wasn't just about money,

340
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:36,360
but also emotional factors.

341
00:15:03,080 --> 00:15:03,640
Grandma,

342
00:15:04,400 --> 00:15:05,460
what are you doing?

343
00:15:05,880 --> 00:15:06,880
Nothing.

344
00:15:07,400 --> 00:15:08,460
I was just checking

345
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:11,360
if Grandpa is asleep.

346
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:14,040
It's so late. Why aren't you asleep yet?

347
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:14,960
Where's your mom?

348
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,480
Bozhou,

349
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:15,880
what are you doing?

350
00:15:15,880 --> 00:15:16,740
Come back here.

351
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:18,760
Don't disturb Grandpa and Grandma.

352
00:15:19,160 --> 00:15:19,440
Mom.

353
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:20,660
Did we wake you?

354
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,250
Go back to sleep.

355
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,380
I'll put him to bed.

356
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,200
Take him to bed.

357
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:26,740
It's getting late.

358
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,960
I've resented Li Hongkang

359
00:15:37,720 --> 00:15:39,120
for years.

360
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:41,130
He always looked down on me,

361
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:43,300
thinking I was uneducated

362
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:45,050
and not good enough for him.

363
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,180
In all these years,

364
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:50,200
he never said a single nice thing to me.

365
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,880
And he would beat me

366
00:15:53,080 --> 00:15:53,960
for no reason.

367
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,200
I'm old now,

368
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,780
and I can't even get a divorce.

369
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,580
I've really had enough

370
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:10,000
of this life.

371
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,880
I hate him to death.

372
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:16,760
How much?

373
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,900
Enough to want to kill him?

374
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,120
I wanted to cut him

375
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:26,320
into a thousand pieces.

376
00:16:29,280 --> 00:16:30,880
Anyway, he's already dead.

377
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:32,800
I've confessed everything

378
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:33,680
I should.

379
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:36,240
There's nothing more to say.

380
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:38,560
I just beg you

381
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:40,250
to sentence me already.

382
00:16:41,080 --> 00:16:42,120
To me right now,

383
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:44,520
living another day is just torture.

384
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,530
I'm begging you.

385
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,250
I've really had enough.

386
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:50,520
I don't want to live anymore.

387
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:51,440
Then tell me,

388
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:52,860
who is Lu Minchuan?

389
00:17:05,599 --> 00:17:07,730
The self-introduction was detailed,

390
00:17:08,119 --> 00:17:09,280
but it sounded rehearsed.

391
00:17:09,280 --> 00:17:11,410
I feel like they're putting on a front.

392
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,099
These two have never even met.

393
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,770
Why is Zhou Yumei so madly
in love with him?

394
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,079
Elderly people nowadays

395
00:17:18,079 --> 00:17:20,160
even fall for fake profiles
in short videos.

396
00:17:20,160 --> 00:17:22,020
They cry and beg to give them money

397
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:23,579
and run away with them.

398
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,240
Could this Lu Minchuan

399
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,240
also be one of those scammers

400
00:17:26,240 --> 00:17:27,569
who target the elderly?

401
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:30,740
It's hard to say right now.

402
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,610
Judging from the chat history,

403
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:34,520
you and Lu Minchuan were
romantically involved,

404
00:17:34,520 --> 00:17:36,280
and you even expressed your love for him.

405
00:17:36,280 --> 00:17:37,360
But you didn't mention this

406
00:17:37,360 --> 00:17:38,760
in your confession.

407
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:39,720
Why?

408
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:42,440
Because this has nothing to do with him,

409
00:17:42,440 --> 00:17:43,700
so I didn't mention it.

410
00:17:44,160 --> 00:17:45,490
I did this all by myself.

411
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,960
I don't want to implicate innocent people.

412
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,680
We need you to confess truthfully.

413
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,200
Tell us the people

414
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,770
and things you know.

415
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:54,880
As for whether it's related to the case,

416
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,240
we'll be the judge of that.

417
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,320
Is that necessary?

418
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,440
I've already confessed.

419
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,040
What else do you want from me?

420
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:03,360
Just sentence me already.

421
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:04,680
It is.

422
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,400
Please cooperate with our investigation.

423
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:13,600
Back then,

424
00:18:14,600 --> 00:18:17,260
he and Li Hongkang
were both sent to our village.

425
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:19,960
I fell in love with him

426
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,920
at that time.

427
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,500
Half a year ago,

428
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,380
he suddenly reached out to me.

429
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,780
He said he searched for a long time

430
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:33,080
to find my contact info.

431
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:34,560
Since then,

432
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,360
we chatted frequently.

433
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:38,560
Lu

434
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,720
respected me a lot.

435
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,560
Compared to Li Hongkang,

436
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,240
they were like night

437
00:18:46,280 --> 00:18:47,280
and day.

438
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:50,560
Did Li Hongkang know
about you and Lu Minchuan?

439
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:54,160
He didn't.

440
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,570
Did you ever meet in person
while you were dating?

441
00:18:58,480 --> 00:18:58,920
No.

442
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,520
But he said

443
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:05,640
as long as I could get away
from Li Hongkang,

444
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:07,800
he would come for me.

445
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:08,480
But

446
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:11,200
Lu Minchuan also said
something else to you.

447
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:13,400
Li Hongkang isn't worth
all your sacrifices.

448
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,240
As long as he's around,

449
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:15,500
you'll never be happy.

450
00:19:15,760 --> 00:19:17,160
You can't let him ruin you.

451
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:18,320
You also need to think...

452
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:19,840
I have to do something for you two.

453
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:20,720
Is that so?

454
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,180
Based on your understanding,

455
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:25,100
what did Lu Minchuan mean by that?

456
00:19:26,120 --> 00:19:27,240
I don't know.

457
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,200
You're overthinking it.

458
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:31,130
He didn't ask me to do anything.

459
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:33,440
This really has nothing to do with him.

460
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:34,400
I committed the murder.

461
00:19:34,400 --> 00:19:35,800
I've already confessed.

462
00:19:35,800 --> 00:19:37,240
I beg you, stop investigating.

463
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,800
Stop investigating, okay?

464
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:40,000
I'm begging you.
